        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I have been a regular at this outlet since the last 2 years. I have attended many events of PCChandra as a guest of PCChandra Madhyamgram.\nThe showroom, PCChandra Madhyamgram, boasts of exquisite light weight jewellery with an enviable stock. Pritha, Sujan, Nandita make it a point to listen to my preferences carefully. They are very courteous and have catered to all my demands with a smile . Pritha, Nandita and Sujan with their expertise always guide me to choose the best cost -weight ratio jewellery . Thank you guys !! Also I would like to mention Ankita, Anirban, Sarbojit for their warm hospitality.",
        "time": 1746197278
      },
