        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "We had a wonderful experience at P.C. Chandra Jewellers, Madhyamgram. The staff, including the guards, floor manager, and sales team, were very respectful and welcoming. Special thanks to Debosmita, who patiently helped us find the perfect pair of earrings as per our liking. She even coordinated with another store to check for more designs. The store offers a great variety of designs and excellent hospitality. Highly recommended!",
